| 2 | `redteam-network` | Public exposure, NSGs, segmentation |
| 2 | `redteam-compute` | VM, VMSS, App Service, Functions, serverless |
| 2 | `redteam-aks-container` | AKS, ACR, Container Apps/Instances — Kubernetes & container posture (read-only) |
| 2 | `redteam-data` | Storage, Key Vault, databases |
| 2 | `redteam-web` | Web edge/delivery: WAF, TLS, static sites, APIM |
| 2 | `redteam-ai` | Azure AI Foundry, OpenAI, Cognitive Services, ML |
