| 2.6 (gated) | `redteam-aks-container` (cluster-active lane) | **Active** in-cluster/in-container testing (kube-bench/kubesec, offline image scanning, benign read-only in-pod inventory). Dispatched **only** when `mode: cluster-active-testing` AND `cluster_testing.enabled: true` with a signed authorization. Off by default. (Same agent as the order-2 read-only lane.) |
